Building.CanProduce: a building that needs another one (Bank, University, Cathedral and the other requiredBuilding entries in ruleset.json) is buildable once the city has that building; the check compared the city's buildings with the building itself, so none of them could ever be built.

--- a/C7Engine/C7GameData/Building.cs
+++ b/C7Engine/C7GameData/Building.cs
@@ -142,8 +142,10 @@ namespace C7GameData {
 				return false;
 			}
 
+			// The city itself must have the prerequisite (a Temple for a
+			// Cathedral, a Marketplace for a Bank, ...).
 			if (requiredBuilding != null &&
-				!city.GetBuildings().Exists(cityBuilding => cityBuilding.building == this)) {
+				!city.GetBuildings().Exists(cityBuilding => cityBuilding.building == requiredBuilding)) {
 				return false;
 			}
 
